Subject: [PATCH] Add pinch-to-zoom to photo viewer

New ZoomImageView: pinch zoom 1x-6x, pan when zoomed, double-tap 3x/fit,
edge clamping, reset on new bitmap. Used for viewerImage in
dialog_media_viewer; hint texts mention the gesture.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
